      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I fail to see a need for VRC to implement a special restriction or stop distribution of it. VRC already has several settings that can handle it. \n\nWe have the ability for instance owners to turn off items, users can individually hide items that are annoying them and you can turn sounds off for items completely. There’s a lot of phobias and people with phobias out there. Does VRC have to start catering how it handles items to all phobias now? If someone is being problematic with it, they can be dealt with via moderation tools. Same if they had similar functionality on their avatar.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
