      "value": "@{628fc7f00ef1020b6030ba2c|full_name}\n\nI don’t personally have PTSD, but can you really say that to everyone who has a genuine phobia of bugs?\n\nWhat you’re saying is like telling a past victim of bullying to watch someone being bullied, or forcing someone to look at their greatest fear and saying, \"Since there's a hide button, just look at it for a second, feel sick, and then hide it.\"\n\nDo you see what I'm getting at?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
