      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a structural problem, not a problem with a specific item.\n\nIf we consider the possibility of Items becoming a UGC area in the future, VRCdev should implement Safety-Menu for Item categories to add these items.\n\nCeasing the sale and distribution of the \"Bee Blaster\" will definitely be a bad move. As the current situation shows, it is clear that some UGC lacks consideration. \n\nThe consideration that VRCdev should take is not to eliminate something, but to provide a way to prevent harm.\n\nOf course, some things that go too far should be eliminated.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
