      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have a huge fear (phobia possibly) of bees, wasp, and hornets. I could see this being mis-used to trigger fear into someone with that phobia.\n\nMaybe if there would be a way to disable certain individual items, that would be a step in the right direction.",
