  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-04-02T09:22:42.527Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "We strongly request that you either cease the sale and distribution of the \"Bee Blaster\" as a VRC+ item or implement a specific feature to hide/disable it.\n\nhttps://x.com/VRChat/status/2039499341635719577\n\nOur request is based on the following concerns:\n\n1. Aversion to sounds: The buzzing sounds of bees cause significant distress.\n\n2. Entomophobia: Many users have a strong dislike of bees, even in 2D or stylized forms.\n\n3. PTSD Triggers: For some, these triggers can lead to serious psychological distress (PTSD).\n\nInclusivity: We ask for respect toward users who suffer from insect phobias.\n\nThere is a large global community of people who suffer from such phobias. While we love other VRC+ items and do not wish to use \"Mute/Hide All Avatar Global Items,\" we find this specific item problematic.\n\nThis situation is similar to the \"sunman\" issue in FISH!. If this item is implemented without a way to filter it, we are prepared to gather international support and signatures from affected users to seek a formal resolution with VRChat Inc.",
